#: scenario7:scenario7_CCCBCFB1_6548_4761_A7EB_DD6CF25A2928
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 6bd7c3c41916585faf8c2ee3baaebb356d85b2ddffcf8e3c39931210e76200cc
